WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.600 --> 01:46.690
=Episode 19=

01:52.200 --> 01:52.800
Why so hesitant?

01:53.470 --> 01:54.190
Hurry up.

01:54.280 --> 01:54.920
Qianjun.

01:54.920 --> 01:55.600
Slow down.

01:56.350 --> 01:58.310
The ground seems to be dug
on both sides.

01:58.880 --> 01:59.400
It's fishy.

02:01.960 --> 02:02.960
Let's discuss first.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.720
Master Yue, what do you say?

02:05.150 --> 02:05.640
To the left.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.120
Do as he says.

02:10.350 --> 02:10.880
To the left.

02:17.550 --> 02:17.960
Xu.

02:18.710 --> 02:19.680
Can we count on him?

02:20.070 --> 02:20.480
Of course.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.680
Remember what he did

02:21.840 --> 02:23.120
at the Langyin Pavilion...

02:26.430 --> 02:27.120
Step aside.

02:32.230 --> 02:33.590
Sect leader.

02:33.680 --> 02:34.230
Bad news.

02:34.960 --> 02:37.120
The Zhengwu Alliance
is breaking in from the front gate.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.960
Our people are badly injured.

02:39.070 --> 02:40.550
Sect leader, bad news.

02:40.910 --> 02:41.480
What now?

02:41.480 --> 02:41.960
Sect leader.

02:43.030 --> 02:44.800
Someone broke in from the back door.

02:44.960 --> 02:46.430
How can you be so useless?

02:47.160 --> 02:48.190
Why did they come

02:48.320 --> 02:49.640
to mess things up?

02:50.150 --> 02:51.470
Stop them.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.440
Jinzhao, are you okay?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.000
I'm fine.

03:03.280 --> 03:03.760
Mr. Xu.

03:05.680 --> 03:06.230
Mr. Xu.

03:07.150 --> 03:08.000
- Mr. Xu.
- Xu.

03:08.910 --> 03:09.590
Xu.

03:17.590 --> 03:18.190
I'm sorry.

03:21.190 --> 03:22.720
Can your apology
bring them back to life?

03:24.960 --> 03:25.910
To the left?

03:26.360 --> 03:27.440
It was awful.

03:27.720 --> 03:29.110
Calm down.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.400
Bad news.

03:30.400 --> 03:30.910
Mr. Chen.

03:31.079 --> 03:32.400
Qiyuan Sect's disciples are coming.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.110
It's urgent.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.470
Consider yourself lucky.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.000
Yue Jinzhao.

03:44.640 --> 03:45.150
Calm down.

03:46.079 --> 03:47.870
Let's think about
what we should do next.

03:51.150 --> 03:52.310
They noticed us.

03:53.800 --> 03:54.600
We should split up.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.000
Go get Gao Xiao.

03:57.829 --> 04:00.360
And the others should stall the guards.

04:02.310 --> 04:02.950
Yue Jinzhao.

04:03.670 --> 04:05.030
I see what you're trying to do.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.750
You want us to die and buy you time.

04:09.030 --> 04:09.800
I'll stay with you.

04:10.830 --> 04:12.240
We'll stay with you.

04:12.750 --> 04:13.360
Me too.

04:14.440 --> 04:16.240
Go with Miss Yue to get Gao Xiao.

04:16.640 --> 04:17.640
Yue Jinzhao, remember.

04:18.160 --> 04:19.279
All our casualties

04:19.550 --> 04:20.459
and all the bloodshed

04:20.800 --> 04:21.470
are on you.

04:22.440 --> 04:23.080
Let's go.

04:29.640 --> 04:30.520
Be careful.

04:32.830 --> 04:33.320
Let's go.

04:40.159 --> 04:40.640
Jinzhao.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.600
Mr. Gu told us before we took off

04:43.950 --> 04:44.880
that it'd be risky.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.750
But we came, anyway.

04:47.750 --> 04:48.550
In that case,

04:49.440 --> 04:50.909
we must save more people.

04:51.670 --> 04:52.240
Right?

05:00.750 --> 05:01.110
Yeah.

05:27.830 --> 05:31.000
It's you two making trouble here again.

05:31.750 --> 05:33.670
Aren't you a bit too bold?

05:34.310 --> 05:35.240
You've done too much evil.

05:35.830 --> 05:36.360
Today,

05:37.080 --> 05:38.000
I'll finish you off.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.670
How dare you talk nonsense

05:43.000 --> 05:44.550
at my place?

05:44.830 --> 05:46.720
Since you are here,

05:46.950 --> 05:48.750
don't think about leaving.

07:04.760 --> 07:06.760
Jinzhao, these disciples look crazy.

07:06.760 --> 07:08.110
It's because of the Qiyuan Orb.

07:08.110 --> 07:08.440
Gao Xiao.

07:32.440 --> 07:34.280
Thank you, Lord Ming.

07:35.159 --> 07:35.760
Jinzhao.

07:36.320 --> 07:37.040
Let me try.

07:37.040 --> 07:37.880
I can save them.

07:39.230 --> 07:39.950
Stall them.

07:48.159 --> 07:48.760
Help me.

07:56.350 --> 07:57.110
Thank you, Lord Ming.

07:59.720 --> 08:00.760
Thank you, Lord Ming.

08:00.760 --> 08:01.670
Thank you, Lord Ming.

08:05.440 --> 08:06.480
Qi, no.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.320
You're going to...

08:08.630 --> 08:09.510
I won't die.

08:10.040 --> 08:11.480
We can't leave them manipulated.

09:01.260 --> 09:02.890
Why did you catalyze
so many Qiyuan Orbs?

09:04.510 --> 09:05.390
You came, after all.

09:05.880 --> 09:06.670
Why did you do that?

09:08.440 --> 09:10.440
Qi has consumed the Qiyuan Orbs before.

09:11.160 --> 09:12.070
She wasn't demonized.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.760
Instead, she gained power.

09:14.670 --> 09:16.920
It's her chance
to consume more Qiyuan Orbs and activate

09:17.320 --> 09:18.920
the power of a mythical beast.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.350
How can I let it go?

09:24.550 --> 09:25.070
Luohuan.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.440
Luohuan.

09:40.670 --> 09:41.040
Qi.

09:42.510 --> 09:43.150
Qi.

09:45.480 --> 09:47.160
Jinzhao, it hurts.

09:51.720 --> 09:54.320
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

09:55.950 --> 09:58.550
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

09:59.150 --> 10:01.600
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

10:02.640 --> 10:05.320
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

10:07.440 --> 10:08.280
The Qiyuan Orbs contain

10:08.280 --> 10:09.720
dark feelings of dying people.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.670
Aren't you afraid Qi would

10:12.110 --> 10:13.480
get overwhelmed and lose consciousness?

10:14.280 --> 10:16.280
I never do anything uncertain.

10:19.390 --> 10:20.040
What are you doing?

10:20.430 --> 10:21.320
Saving her.

10:24.390 --> 10:24.750
Luohuan.

10:26.960 --> 10:29.420
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

10:29.420 --> 10:33.080
♪They symbolize my love♪

10:33.080 --> 10:38.730
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

10:41.040 --> 10:44.770
♪Following your shadow across miles♪

10:45.950 --> 10:46.680
(Bian Luohuan.)

10:47.800 --> 10:49.070
(He could resonate with Qi.)

10:49.680 --> 10:52.120
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

10:52.880 --> 10:55.240
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

10:56.140 --> 10:58.480
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

10:59.210 --> 11:02.190
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

11:03.950 --> 11:06.060
♪Wishing for a perfect ending♪

11:07.070 --> 11:07.480
Luohuan.

11:08.590 --> 11:12.380
♪How do I calm it♪

11:12.380 --> 11:15.040
♪I've given it my all♪

11:15.560 --> 11:16.430
You saw it.

11:17.630 --> 11:19.390
The Resonance Spell
between Yue Jinzhao and Qi

11:19.830 --> 11:21.310
has surpassed yours.

11:26.990 --> 11:28.480
Isn't it what we want?

11:36.360 --> 11:38.760
♪If love arises with the wind♪

11:38.760 --> 11:41.360
♪How do I calm it♪

11:41.360 --> 11:43.800
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

11:46.120 --> 11:48.120
(Qi, wake up.)

11:49.040 --> 11:50.630
(Our friends are fighting the enemies.)

11:51.160 --> 11:52.430
(Let's fight alongside them.)

11:53.390 --> 11:54.360
(Wake up now.)

11:55.120 --> 12:00.490
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

12:24.160 --> 12:26.480
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

12:28.280 --> 12:30.800
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

12:31.510 --> 12:34.040
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

12:35.120 --> 12:36.720
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

12:36.720 --> 12:37.630
They broke in.

12:38.560 --> 12:40.040
- Run!
- Run!

13:22.510 --> 13:23.160
Qi.

13:24.950 --> 13:25.510
Qi.

13:26.720 --> 13:27.800
Little Yue?

13:28.430 --> 13:30.120
Miss Yue made that sound?

13:33.070 --> 13:33.680
Jinzhao.

13:34.680 --> 13:35.600
We made it.

13:35.990 --> 13:37.830
Yeah, we made it.

13:40.800 --> 13:41.280
Miss Yue.

13:48.870 --> 13:49.480
She's fine.

13:49.560 --> 13:50.750
That's our Lord Ming!

13:50.870 --> 13:51.800
Lord Ming is amazing!

13:52.040 --> 13:53.310
It's Lord Ming!

13:53.310 --> 13:54.190
That's our Lord Ming!

13:54.190 --> 13:55.480
It is Lord Ming.

13:56.160 --> 13:57.160
Lord Ming!

13:57.480 --> 13:58.280
She's Lord Ming!

13:58.800 --> 13:59.430
She's Lord Ming!

14:04.720 --> 14:06.190
Is Miss Yue really Lord Ming?

14:07.240 --> 14:08.070
No, she's not.

14:09.040 --> 14:09.990
It doesn't matter.

14:10.870 --> 14:11.630
Catch her first.

14:11.720 --> 14:14.040
- Protect Lord Ming.
- Protect Lord Ming.

14:16.310 --> 14:16.870
Mr. Zuo.

14:17.280 --> 14:19.040
Miss Yue is the young lord
of the Yu Clan

14:19.190 --> 14:20.390
and the descendant
of mythical beast Kun.

14:20.750 --> 14:21.950
She is not Lord Ming.

14:22.280 --> 14:22.680
Besides,

14:22.950 --> 14:24.630
she's never done anything wrong.

14:24.950 --> 14:25.750
Yeah, leader.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.240
I've visited the Yu Clan.

14:28.950 --> 14:29.510
Everyone,

14:30.310 --> 14:31.800
as the leader of the Zhengwu Alliance,

14:32.560 --> 14:34.830
there are things I have to do.

14:35.600 --> 14:35.990
Arrest her.

14:36.390 --> 14:37.120
Guanren.

14:39.390 --> 14:40.720
I understand that.

14:41.280 --> 14:43.240
But I have to stand against you.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.950
If she is Lord Ming,

14:47.870 --> 14:50.510
then why is she helping you
destroy the Qiyuan Sect?

14:54.240 --> 14:55.040
Bian Luohuan.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.240
Who are you?

14:56.750 --> 14:58.750
Mr. Zuo, calm down.

14:59.480 --> 15:00.120
Luohuan.

15:08.480 --> 15:11.360
Didact, why are you doing this?

15:11.830 --> 15:12.430
Mr. Gao.

15:13.830 --> 15:17.070
You've dedicated yourself
to the Qiyuan Sect for years.

15:17.390 --> 15:17.870
Today,

15:18.430 --> 15:19.360
I'm going to

15:19.920 --> 15:21.480
reward you handsomely.

15:21.720 --> 15:22.870
No...

15:23.390 --> 15:24.990
Please spare my life, Didact.

15:24.990 --> 15:26.280
Spare me.

15:26.390 --> 15:27.240
I...

15:27.310 --> 15:29.950
I don't want to ascend, Didact.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.630
I can't ascend.

15:31.870 --> 15:34.480
I can't die, Didact.

15:35.480 --> 15:36.240
Help me.

15:36.480 --> 15:38.120
Help me.

15:38.870 --> 15:40.280
Why are you stepping back?

15:40.800 --> 15:41.950
Why?

15:42.680 --> 15:43.630
You bunch of...

15:43.990 --> 15:44.750
Bunch of fools!

15:44.920 --> 15:46.560
You... You think

15:46.680 --> 15:47.920
these people in power

15:48.070 --> 15:49.390
are nice and kind?

15:49.920 --> 15:51.950
The Qiyuan Orbs you're craving

15:52.360 --> 15:55.310
feed on your lives.

15:55.950 --> 15:57.990
You don't even know that you're tricked.

15:58.190 --> 15:58.950
Stepping back?

16:00.430 --> 16:02.120
You're all going to die.

16:02.480 --> 16:04.720
All of you!

16:05.040 --> 16:05.950
You...

16:06.240 --> 16:07.360
And all the slaves

16:07.560 --> 16:10.750
are food for Lord Ming.

16:10.750 --> 16:12.510
They're going to die!

16:13.070 --> 16:14.480
Didact.

16:14.950 --> 16:16.270
Didact.

16:16.480 --> 16:18.950
I don't deserve it.

16:19.360 --> 16:20.120
I...

16:26.390 --> 16:26.990
This...

16:29.830 --> 16:30.560
What happened?

16:30.630 --> 16:31.390
What happened?

16:39.680 --> 16:40.190
Everyone,

16:41.870 --> 16:42.950
you saw it.

16:44.120 --> 16:46.390
The so-called ascension

16:47.190 --> 16:48.360
is death.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.040
You were driven by your desire

16:51.310 --> 16:52.830
to blindly seek ascension.

16:53.750 --> 16:56.390
You don't even know
the truth about Lord Ming.

16:56.680 --> 16:59.720
But you go crazy
over some illusory thing

17:00.630 --> 17:02.830
and turn your kindred
against each other.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.560
It is really ridiculous.

17:05.599 --> 17:06.829
Remember my name.

17:08.430 --> 17:09.359
Ying Xuwei.

17:10.359 --> 17:11.160
The Qiyuan Sect

17:11.599 --> 17:12.800
is a gift from

17:13.310 --> 17:15.069
our Hengdao Sect.

17:16.680 --> 17:18.390
I believe we're going

17:18.920 --> 17:20.430
to see each other soon.

17:22.800 --> 17:23.310
Luohuan.

17:24.040 --> 17:24.480
Let's go.

17:26.430 --> 17:26.869
Bian Luohuan.

17:28.430 --> 17:29.310
Who are you?

17:31.190 --> 17:31.870
Yue Jinzhao.

17:32.560 --> 17:33.560
You will find out

17:34.280 --> 17:35.210
when the time is right.

17:38.040 --> 17:38.720
It won't take long.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.240
It's fake.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.040
Everything's fake.

17:46.720 --> 17:47.950
Lord Ming.

17:48.800 --> 17:49.600
Ascension.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.070
Utter nonsense.

17:52.680 --> 17:54.310
The self-destruction device is on.

17:55.240 --> 17:57.240
This place is going to collapse.

17:58.830 --> 18:00.040
Let's die together!

18:00.510 --> 18:02.040
Die together!

18:03.600 --> 18:04.990
Die together!

18:09.870 --> 18:10.480
It's collapsing.

18:11.120 --> 18:12.430
To the exit. Hurry.

18:12.830 --> 18:13.510
It's too late.

18:14.630 --> 18:15.390
Go ahead.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.390
I'll shut down the device.

18:19.160 --> 18:19.680
Master.

18:20.160 --> 18:22.310
Hurry up. Get out of here.

18:22.310 --> 18:23.360
Hurry up.

18:23.360 --> 18:23.750
Go.

18:25.240 --> 18:27.560
- Run!
- Hurry up!

18:29.120 --> 18:29.990
Hurry up!

18:54.800 --> 18:56.270
(Qiyuan Sect's headquarters,
Self-destruction device)

19:05.080 --> 19:05.960
Why did you come?

19:10.390 --> 19:12.920
It's too dangerous here.

19:14.380 --> 19:15.920
This place is deadly.

19:16.080 --> 19:17.920
It may collapse at any time.

19:18.060 --> 19:19.350
Stay put.

19:22.760 --> 19:24.890
Ju Shifang, can you
send Dou Bao to do it?

19:34.990 --> 19:35.560
Ju Shifang.

19:35.750 --> 19:36.440
Hurry up

19:36.590 --> 19:37.710
or we'll die here.

19:40.710 --> 19:41.280
I...

19:52.630 --> 19:53.110
No.

19:54.510 --> 19:55.560
I can't let Dou Bao do it.

19:57.110 --> 19:59.590
I swear I'll protect Dou Bao.

20:01.480 --> 20:06.320
This is the only thing
my mother left me.

20:12.510 --> 20:13.560
(I saw a huge casualty)

20:14.590 --> 20:16.560
(of the Zhengwu Alliance at Pureness.)

20:17.510 --> 20:19.590
(If I don't stop it, I'm afraid...)

20:21.870 --> 20:22.590
Stay put.

20:25.440 --> 20:26.080
Master.

20:26.390 --> 20:27.040
Mr. Gu.

20:27.990 --> 20:28.750
Don't go.

20:43.560 --> 20:44.200
Stay back.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.840
(What happened three years ago)

20:52.160 --> 20:53.800
(has come around today.)

21:21.470 --> 21:22.470
Mr. Gu!

21:23.230 --> 21:23.630
Don't.

21:24.750 --> 21:25.390
Don't go.

21:25.510 --> 21:26.200
- Miss Ming.
- Don't.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.160
- Let go.
- Don't.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.040
Miss Ming.

21:29.160 --> 21:30.350
I said let go.

21:33.750 --> 21:34.470
Miss Ming.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.590
- Wait here.
- Xian Qing.

22:35.040 --> 22:35.880
Master.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.350
You finally woke up.

22:42.680 --> 22:43.630
Xiu.

22:44.350 --> 22:45.110
Stop crying.

22:46.320 --> 22:47.350
I'm fine.

22:52.870 --> 22:54.280
How are you feeling?

22:56.160 --> 22:57.320
I feel

22:59.080 --> 22:59.990
hungry.

23:02.600 --> 23:06.040
Can you find me something to eat?

23:33.840 --> 23:35.510
You rarely leave Mount Yuqing.

23:36.870 --> 23:37.590
Did you leave

23:38.840 --> 23:40.440
because you saw something at Pureness?

23:41.560 --> 23:43.510
Right before Xiu's birthday,

23:43.590 --> 23:44.710
my key ring glowed.

23:45.470 --> 23:46.510
Do you remember?

23:59.200 --> 24:00.040
I'm going to Pureness.

24:01.680 --> 24:03.800
So I decided to go to Pureness.

24:04.590 --> 24:07.080
And I saw the future there.

24:08.160 --> 24:09.280
Pureness showed

24:10.960 --> 24:13.390
that the attack
on the Qiyuan Sect's headquarters

24:13.800 --> 24:15.710
would take a heavy toll
on the Zhengwu Alliance.

24:17.390 --> 24:19.630
How can I sit back and let them

24:21.160 --> 24:22.470
die for the great cause?

24:23.200 --> 24:24.510
So you chose

24:25.920 --> 24:26.960
to sacrifice yourself?

24:29.680 --> 24:31.080
It'd be nice

24:31.440 --> 24:32.840
to change people's fate based on

24:34.080 --> 24:35.560
what I saw at Pureness.

24:43.630 --> 24:44.320
Xian Qing.

24:48.920 --> 24:50.230
Do me a favor.

24:52.160 --> 24:53.750
Can you lend me your demonic orb

24:54.470 --> 24:56.040
to extend my life for half a day?

24:58.750 --> 24:59.560
We're buddies.

25:00.870 --> 25:02.280
All you have to do is ask.

25:08.270 --> 25:09.990
(Li's Pharmacy)

25:11.760 --> 25:13.450
These guys got our buddies killed.

25:13.870 --> 25:15.900
I'd be so ashamed if I were them.

25:15.900 --> 25:17.450
I'd bury my head in the sand.

25:17.450 --> 25:19.310
I heard Mr. Gu was badly hurt.

25:19.310 --> 25:20.500
I wonder how he is now.

25:20.500 --> 25:22.680
Virtue has its reward.
Mr. Gu will be fine.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.970
The Silver Shadow
our leader gave him was a waste.

25:40.160 --> 25:40.560
Senior.

25:41.320 --> 25:41.960
Are you better?

25:44.590 --> 25:45.160
I'm fine.

25:46.320 --> 25:47.560
Since you're here,

25:48.040 --> 25:48.960
come with me.

25:52.320 --> 25:52.710
Senior.

25:53.470 --> 25:53.920
I...

25:53.920 --> 25:55.350
Did I say you could turn me down?

26:00.110 --> 26:01.870
Master, you just woke up.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.510
Don't worry.

26:08.630 --> 26:09.110
Xiu.

26:11.440 --> 26:12.630
This is between them.

26:13.630 --> 26:14.710
Hanjiang knows what he's doing.

26:15.350 --> 26:16.200
Please look after Qi

26:16.710 --> 26:17.470
when she wakes up.

26:18.920 --> 26:19.350
Don't worry.

26:20.280 --> 26:21.390
Zhaoyan will take care of her.

26:22.040 --> 26:22.920
Me too.

26:39.560 --> 26:40.840
Ms. Xu, please accept it.

26:42.800 --> 26:43.750
What...

26:45.350 --> 26:46.040
Mr. Gu.

26:46.710 --> 26:48.080
Why are we here?

26:52.390 --> 26:53.040
Ms. Xu.

26:53.510 --> 26:54.200
Just take it.

26:54.560 --> 26:55.350
We'll bring you

26:55.800 --> 26:57.160
Xu's wage every month

26:57.350 --> 26:58.080
from now on.

26:58.680 --> 27:00.840
He's gone. What wage?

27:03.110 --> 27:04.510
I have to raise my child alone.

27:04.750 --> 27:05.990
But I can work.

27:07.040 --> 27:08.630
We may live a poor life,

27:09.200 --> 27:10.510
but we will get by.

27:11.800 --> 27:13.840
My husband was a folk man

27:14.040 --> 27:15.350
and he did silly things,

27:16.590 --> 27:19.840
but he'd never live on others' sympathy.

27:20.160 --> 27:20.990
Neither will we.

27:21.320 --> 27:22.800
Ms. Xu, you got us wrong.

27:22.990 --> 27:23.870
It's not like that.

27:24.870 --> 27:25.800
Please forgive me.

27:27.200 --> 27:29.630
The Zhengwu Alliance
is only lending you the money

27:30.110 --> 27:30.990
to meet urgent needs.

27:31.560 --> 27:32.680
Once Zhengyun grows up,

27:32.990 --> 27:34.000
he will pay us back.

27:34.570 --> 27:36.040
Ms. Xu, please accept it.

27:36.560 --> 27:37.080
Ms. Xu.

27:40.110 --> 27:40.840
Thank you.

27:46.200 --> 27:46.750
Zhengyun.

27:47.320 --> 27:48.320
Your father was a great man.

27:49.320 --> 27:51.440
Protect your mother from now on.

27:52.800 --> 27:53.710
I will.

27:57.800 --> 28:00.080
Ms. Xu, we will take our leave.

28:10.080 --> 28:10.630
Mother.

28:11.870 --> 28:13.870
I'll be a hero once I grow up

28:14.200 --> 28:16.080
and bring you gifts.

28:18.200 --> 28:18.870
Good boy.

28:19.870 --> 28:21.110
You can be a scholar

28:21.440 --> 28:22.440
or a businessman,

28:22.800 --> 28:23.750
not a fighter.

28:25.080 --> 28:26.870
We'll stay away from jianghu.

28:27.710 --> 28:29.110
If your father was alive,

28:29.510 --> 28:31.350
he'd want you to be safe.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.990
Find a good girl and marry her.

28:34.560 --> 28:36.710
We'll live a peaceful life together.

28:37.510 --> 28:39.040
Don't try to be a hero.

28:40.080 --> 28:42.280
But Father was a hero.

28:44.630 --> 28:46.750
But then you wouldn't be able to see me.

28:47.230 --> 28:49.080
Do you still want to be a hero?

28:49.470 --> 28:50.200
Mother.

28:50.680 --> 28:53.040
Will I never see Father again?

28:57.440 --> 28:59.510
Mother, I miss Father.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.590
I want Father.

29:02.390 --> 29:03.870
I want Father.

29:08.280 --> 29:09.160
Don't turn away.

29:10.230 --> 29:12.960
Remember this very moment.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.630
Don't ever forget it.

29:16.920 --> 29:21.160
Mother, I want Father.

29:22.200 --> 29:22.920
Be good.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.320
You're a tough boy.

29:24.680 --> 29:25.680
Tough boys don't cry.

29:29.200 --> 29:31.320
Mother, I'm a tough boy.

29:31.920 --> 29:33.200
I will grow up soon

29:33.440 --> 29:34.750
and protect you for Father.

29:44.560 --> 29:46.390
Xu Qiming, bad guy.

29:47.630 --> 29:50.320
You said we'd grow old together
on our wedding day.

29:52.280 --> 29:53.840
But you just died.

29:54.510 --> 29:56.560
I shouldn't have married you.

29:58.560 --> 29:59.040
Let's go.

30:23.870 --> 30:24.350
Senior.

30:25.800 --> 30:26.960
Why did you show us that?

30:31.990 --> 30:33.200
Tell me.

30:34.110 --> 30:35.870
Why were you so upset this morning?

30:38.320 --> 30:38.840
I...

30:41.280 --> 30:41.990
I was scared.

30:44.080 --> 30:45.440
I was scared that I might

30:46.350 --> 30:47.320
be cursed and condemned.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.040
I was scared

30:50.390 --> 30:51.160
I'd be hated.

30:53.840 --> 30:54.630
Me too.

30:57.630 --> 30:58.390
And now?

30:59.160 --> 30:59.800
I'm still scared.

31:00.750 --> 31:02.080
They were once alive.

31:02.560 --> 31:03.280
They had friends

31:04.230 --> 31:04.920
and families.

31:05.510 --> 31:06.080
But they died

31:07.160 --> 31:08.040
because of me.

31:09.510 --> 31:10.200
It's my fault.

31:12.630 --> 31:13.160
My fault.

31:15.340 --> 31:16.660
I was overly confident

31:19.470 --> 31:22.250
and made people
lose their family members.

31:28.230 --> 31:29.920
I got so many people killed

31:31.080 --> 31:32.750
but I couldn't face it.

31:35.390 --> 31:36.710
I was so selfish

31:37.510 --> 31:38.960
and almost got you killed.

31:43.990 --> 31:45.160
What scares me the most

31:45.630 --> 31:47.080
is that I am a coward.

31:47.990 --> 31:49.590
Such a coward

31:50.320 --> 31:52.410
will never become a hero.

31:52.470 --> 31:52.960
Get up.

32:02.630 --> 32:03.280
Get up.

32:03.960 --> 32:04.960
Leave me alone.

32:05.870 --> 32:06.840
You get to cry?

32:07.510 --> 32:08.750
Who says you get to cry?

32:08.750 --> 32:09.560
Why can't I cry?

32:09.750 --> 32:11.280
Who says guys can't cry?

32:14.080 --> 32:14.870
You pushed me?

32:15.230 --> 32:16.810
Yue Jinzhao, you pushed me!

32:17.130 --> 32:18.120
Are you done?

32:19.080 --> 32:20.680
You think only you're upset?

33:09.040 --> 33:10.110
Don't belittle yourself.

33:11.350 --> 33:12.510
You've done pretty well.

33:13.750 --> 33:14.470
I'm sorry.

33:15.160 --> 33:15.750
Jinzhao.

33:17.560 --> 33:19.080
But I want to do better.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.080
I will never forget

33:22.840 --> 33:24.160
what has happened.

33:26.280 --> 33:26.960
Me neither.

33:29.320 --> 33:30.320
Are you done fighting?

33:48.280 --> 33:49.630
It looks like you've realized

33:50.440 --> 33:52.110
that you can't undo your mistakes

33:52.880 --> 33:54.800
but you can make amends.

33:56.330 --> 33:59.790
Fear not of the past
to not fear the future.

34:00.390 --> 34:00.960
Mr. Gu.

34:02.110 --> 34:02.630
You said

34:04.160 --> 34:04.990
that guardians of Pureness

34:04.990 --> 34:06.870
can see fragments
of the future sometimes.

34:07.590 --> 34:08.080
Then...

34:09.469 --> 34:10.920
Do you believe in what you've seen?

34:13.350 --> 34:13.900
Yes, I do.

34:15.560 --> 34:16.510
But I've also said

34:17.110 --> 34:18.630
that the future can be changed.

34:20.520 --> 34:23.920
Even if the future is a mess,
you have Miss Yue with you.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.440
Take this coin as a token.

34:37.110 --> 34:39.080
Don't forget what I said today.

34:53.840 --> 34:55.199
Mr. Ju, don't feel guilty.

34:56.300 --> 34:58.090
We have different things to protect.

34:58.540 --> 35:01.380
I made my choice
and I would bear the consequences.

35:02.590 --> 35:03.080
Alright.

35:03.920 --> 35:04.750
Go back.

35:06.230 --> 35:06.990
Thank you, Senior.

35:12.990 --> 35:13.440
Qi.

35:16.230 --> 35:16.680
Qi.

35:24.350 --> 35:25.470
Why are you fully covered?

35:26.960 --> 35:28.440
Don't be suffocated.

35:32.080 --> 35:32.390
Qi.

35:36.160 --> 35:36.510
Qi.

35:39.440 --> 35:40.040
Jinzhao.

35:43.340 --> 35:44.440
Did I scare you?

35:50.990 --> 35:53.320
You look upset these days.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.950
So I want to cheer you up.

35:56.990 --> 35:57.750
What's wrong?

35:59.320 --> 35:59.840
Nothing.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.150
I just want to hug you.

36:09.640 --> 36:10.040
Qi.

36:20.990 --> 36:22.400
I hope you'll stay with me

36:23.800 --> 36:24.670
forever.

36:26.360 --> 36:26.950
Jinzhao.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.190
I will stay with you forever.

37:30.660 --> 37:34.340
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

37:35.680 --> 37:38.250
♪Burns what once was♪

37:39.780 --> 37:42.610
♪The name is forgotten♪

37:46.690 --> 37:50.210
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

37:51.620 --> 37:54.650
♪Only through the eyes♪

37:55.520 --> 37:58.570
♪Who can see them clearly♪

38:00.740 --> 38:06.770
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

38:08.490 --> 38:14.850
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

38:16.700 --> 38:24.190
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:24.740 --> 38:31.230
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

38:48.670 --> 38:52.660
♪The seemingly random paths♪

38:53.700 --> 38:56.550
♪The burning traces♪

38:57.630 --> 39:01.600
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

39:04.740 --> 39:09.030
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

39:09.660 --> 39:12.950
♪Are all carefully♪

39:13.730 --> 39:17.180
♪Arranged by me♪

39:18.660 --> 39:25.600
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:26.660 --> 39:33.630
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:34.660 --> 39:42.240
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

39:42.760 --> 39:49.920
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

39:50.400 --> 39:58.190
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

39:58.660 --> 40:06.210
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

40:06.590 --> 40:14.670
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

40:14.670 --> 40:22.820
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
